        <>{i > 0 ? ', ' : ' '}<a href={`/writing/${p.slug}/`}>{p.title}</a></>
      ))}.
    </p>
    <p class="out reading lens-detail">
      The long-form work behind all of this, by Jason Jeyanandan, who set
      this Foundation up:
      <a href="https://jeyanandan.com/blog/meta-dax/">Meta DAX: An Introduction</a>,
      <a href="https://jeyanandan.com/blog/the-constraint/">The Constraint</a>, and
      <a href="https://github.com/ObsidianDelta/Fuckery">Fuckery</a>,
      published in full with its dead ends left in.
    </p>
